---
/** Transcript: cues down a sheet, each a time and its words: the one heard is faint, the current one has risen as a small sheet, the rest wait in plain ink. */
---

<span class="cover-sheet cover-stack" style="width:208px; padding:6px; --gap:2px">
  <span class="cover-line" style="padding:8px; --gap:10px; align-items:start"><i class="cover-bar cover-bar-faint" style="width:16px"></i><span class="cover-stack" style="--gap:6px"><i class="cover-bar cover-bar-faint" style="width:132px"></i><i class="cover-bar cover-bar-faint" style="width:84px"></i></span></span>
  <span class="cover-row cover-row-current" style="height:auto; padding:8px; --gap:10px; align-items:start"><i class="cover-bar cover-bar-strong" style="width:16px"></i><span class="cover-stack" style="--gap:6px"><i class="cover-bar cover-bar-strong" style="width:140px"></i><i class="cover-bar cover-bar-strong" style="width:96px"></i></span></span>
  <span class="cover-line" style="padding:8px; --gap:10px; align-items:start"><i class="cover-bar cover-bar-faint" style="width:16px"></i><span class="cover-stack" style="--gap:6px"><i class="cover-bar" style="width:128px"></i><i class="cover-bar" style="width:60px"></i></span></span>
</span>
